  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_74936aa4-32f1-4c53-9dea-3324fffbc6d0.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4emGJgRY3k\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_e4321bc8-03c3-43b7-8e7f-dc4e0c1f2fb8.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-legendary-edition.gitbook.io%252fminecraft-legendary-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_ad94e309-9ad9-4b83-8307-9c2389b7a4db.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flegendaryworkshop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_79b8a6de-f9f6-4529-8b8e-db21f5cbad7e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"73\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MinecraftLegendaryEdition/featured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_f080cedc-12ef-442e-a021-6d3f7353b8cc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252flegendary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_d8ce84c4-cc2a-41b4-a48e-766a8003482f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_337164f7-716a-452b-adcf-0d2796b2e5f4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_125cbdcb-7e64-4268-9c57-cda95685f11d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_fdb7303d-9594-47e9-ad6e-c3fdd0fe8a9f.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_7385417b-0f07-4d93-8c85-b0141e68022b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_6cd3442f-1070-4a8d-84ed-14f48c218d54.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_6dd63897-2598-486c-b910-bc7c3f75c407.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_a6863234-17f5-41d3-8c83-dc9efc211c18.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_c2a87a47-b20a-41f5-b328-eadf22295b55.png\" width=\"20\"> <strong><em>點擊此處聆聽我們的原創原聲帶 (OST)</em></strong> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_8a6c5d9d-64d1-4a91-a9e5-fd136158d6ac.png\" width=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopen.spotify.com%252fintl-fr%252falbum%252f7MpcLZUp5vpiKpEEuBgcRX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_67cb69bc-a5bd-4ee0-98b8-568a7803da80.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopen.spotify.com%252fintl-fr%252falbum%252f1JzGLwTjxzSVlgLaGQOZkH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_a7a435d4-21ce-4bcc-852d-1caf308d7f1b.png\" width=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">這三個關鍵字是我們構築這段旅程的基石。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_5b29e8d3-d811-4cb0-939e-f1baf3082dd8.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_f393ff20-8410-4aa0-8feb-d965499836c8.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"258\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">在優秀的 BSL 作者協助下，為此整合包特別重製的自訂著色器包</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_9ce98867-c731-45b5-9449-541d8401409a.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>基於知名的 BSL 著色器包，我們為《Minecraft Legendary Edition》特別打造了專屬版本。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">由美術團隊精心手作的全新物品與強力工具</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_7fb97954-dcd8-4cc0-85a9-9cf049b0d23d.png\" width=\"761\" height=\"189\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>《Minecraft Legendary Edition》充分展現了我們自有藝術家與建築師團隊的心血。 </strong></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">為了打造最引人入勝的冒險體驗，我們開發了專屬模組套件，以搭配嚴選的高品質模組陣容。</span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>我們自主設計了各種生物、物品、方塊、建築結構以及遊戲機制調整...</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_2b86aaa9-9d6b-4db9-8dc9-e1c1764c0838.gif\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>全新的溫度和口渴系統</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_c01b0c74-f83f-4fe5-a8b2-6e1101fcae71.gif\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>嶄新生物</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_706f2a36-b905-4068-80ee-7ca251a0c25a.gif\" width=\"147\" height=\"250\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_78e20059-cb2e-42aa-be14-6a3668ba0bf6.gif\" width=\"189\" height=\"250\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_4fbc2c90-5e81-4a81-aeb0-4a7a295bf6c8.gif\" width=\"214\" height=\"250\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_d4c8c2db-1104-4063-a29f-b146b686b5d6.gif\" width=\"173\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>全新客製化技能樹</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_c61d20ab-f6df-4978-b5a8-1f57280b3446.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>- 本整合包會移植至 Fabric 平台嗎？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">不會</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>- 本整合包會移植至未來版本嗎？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">該整合包目前僅提供 1.16.5 與 1.20.1 版本，我們暫無計劃支援其他版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>- 你們未來有什麼計畫嗎？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">有的！首要工作將是全面重做任務系統。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>- 這個整合包已經完全就緒了嗎？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">尚未。目前仍處於測試版階段。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>- 是否有維基百科頁面可以了解遊戲內容與玩法？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我們正在撰寫中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>鳴謝</strong></span></h2>\n<p>BSL Shaders - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">MinunCraft resource pack - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fminuncraft%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/minuncraft/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Hyblock Textures - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhypixel.net%252fthreads%252fhyblock-hypixel-skyblock-resource-pack.2250035%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hypixel.net/threads/hyblock-hypixel-skyblock-resource-pack.2250035/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Stay True - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Far Block Hypixel Skyblock resource pack - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhypixel.net%252fthreads%252ffar-block-hypixel-skyblock-resource-pack.2377411%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hypixel.net/threads/far-block-hypixel-skyblock-resource-pack.2377411/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">FurfSky resource pack - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhypixel.net%252fthreads%252f16x-pack-furfsky-compatibility-hotfix-v1-7-1.2138599%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hypixel.net/threads/16x-pack-furfsky-compatibility-hotfix-v1-7-1.2138599/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Gigeno (Age of Plastic monument) - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fthe-age-of-plastic-grarantanna-contest%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/the-age-of-plastic-grarantanna-contest/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Pillager to Pirates - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pillagertopirate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pillagertopirate</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Minxie's Mob Textures - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fminxie-s-mob-texture%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/minxie-s-mob-texture/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">More Nether Roots Texture pack - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fmore-nether-roots%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/more-nether-roots/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Animations+ - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fanimations-4656069%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/animations-4656069/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Pretty Prismarine - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fpretty-prismarine%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/pretty-prismarine/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">emerald+ - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252femerald-5150206%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/emerald-5150206/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Elegant Japanese Pagoda - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252felegant-japanese-pagoda%252fcomment%252f10012443%252f%2523reply_10012443\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/elegant-japanese-pagoda/comment/10012443/#reply_10012443</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">New Desert Temples | Better Structures - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fnew-desert-temples-better-structures%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/new-desert-temples-better-structures/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">New Pillagers | Better Structures - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fnew-pillagers-better-structures%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/new-pillagers-better-structures/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Skeleton Retexture - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmob-skin%252fremaking-vanilla-skeleton%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mob-skin/remaking-vanilla-skeleton/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Torrezx-Better Iron - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ftorrezx-better-iron%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/torrezx-better-iron/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Boulevardier - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fboulevardier%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/boulevardier/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Nexo Assets - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f18%252fnexo-assets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/vendors/18/nexo-assets</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">同時感謝協助我們的各位傑出人士：Capt Tatsu, Paulevs, General Disarray, CraisinLord, Bandit_Bytes, flasz., Alp, MrDadone, !Bluehaze142, Merlin Hermes, Vulkaros, Alex</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
